      "writtenOn": "2025-01-27T22:18:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello Patryk,\nCan you please elaborate on your comment? What were you thinking of? I created a version 1 of this command. I want to make sure that what you were suggesting would simplify the solution.",
